1
00:01:49,464 --> 00:01:50,297
十九
Nineteen.

2
00:01:54,255 --> 00:01:55,130
呃啊!
Ugh!

3
00:01:59,380 --> 00:02:00,297
十八
eighteen

4
00:02:24,839 --> 00:02:26,547
啊!
Ah!

5
00:02:35,339 --> 00:02:37,172
十四 十三
fourteen, thirteen.

6
00:02:59,214 --> 00:02:59,797
十
Ten.

7
00:03:13,630 --> 00:03:14,464
七
Seven.

8
00:03:33,589 --> 00:03:34,214
呵
Hmph.

9
00:03:37,505 --> 00:03:38,422
啊!
Ah!

10
00:04:16,297 --> 00:04:18,922
你从未感激过我的才能James
[Watts) You never appreciated my genius, James.

11
00:04:19,714 --> 00:04:23,214
你只是踩在我之上自称巨人罢了
You just stood atop it and called yourself a giant!

12
00:04:29,130 --> 00:04:31,339
我给了你一切你想要的!
I gave you everything you could have wanted!

13
00:04:31,422 --> 00:04:34,214
你在我跟那个阴险小人之间选择了他!
You chose that rat-imbecile over me!

14
00:04:45,714 --> 00:04:47,297
我猜在现在的情境下
I suppose in this instance,

15
00:04:47,339 --> 00:04:50,797
我的智商和你的蛮力打平了
my brains and your brawn are evenly matched.

16
00:04:52,089 --> 00:04:55,464
你是很聪明 但你不是唯一一个会数数的
You're smart, but you're not the only one who can count.

17
00:05:03,505 --> 00:05:04,797
噢 我知道
[Watts] Oh, I know.

18
00:05:22,547 --> 00:05:25,464
刚刚那样对于我来说有点太近了James
[Watts] That was a little too close for my liking, James.

19
00:05:27,964 --> 00:05:31,047
重做那些指环又将大费周章了
Rebuilding those rings is going to be such a pain.

20
00:05:33,422 --> 00:05:36,047
那么 我先走一步
Now, if you'll excuse me.

21
00:05:39,339 --> 00:05:41,880
我劝你最好别那么做
[Watts] I wouldn't do that if I were you.

22
00:05:42,380 --> 00:05:46,839
我是说 除非你想在你的身子里再多加几块金属
mean, unless you're hoping to add more metal to that body of yours

23
00:05:50,422 --> 00:05:54,880
好了 他们把东西放哪了?
All right now, where did they put them?

24
00:06:00,172 --> 00:06:00,922
什么?!
What?!

25
00:06:17,630 --> 00:06:24,380
只要能阻止她 我愿付出任何代价
I will sacrifice whatever it takes to stop her.

26
00:06:27,589 --> 00:06:29,880
噢 我希望你愿意 James
Oh, I hope you do, James.

27
00:06:31,005 --> 00:06:32,672
我希望你愿意
T hope you do.

28
00:06:35,214 --> 00:06:38,130
Tyrian Callows 你被逮捕了
Tyrian Callows, you're under arrest.

29
00:06:40,880 --> 00:06:41,755
哈!
Hya!

30
00:07:57,172 --> 00:07:58,880
看你现在还笑不笑了?
Where's that smile now?

31
00:08:00,839 --> 00:08:02,047
这里是Clover
This is Clover.

32
00:08:02,422 --> 00:08:04,505
请求转移囚犯
Requesting prisoner transport.

33
00:08:09,505 --> 00:08:11,630
我们逮捕了Tyrian Callows
[Clover] We have Tyrian Callows in custody.

34
00:08:25,880 --> 00:08:27,922
所有学生必须留在室内
[Winter] All students are to remain indoors

35
00:08:27,964 --> 00:08:29,255
直到我们发出其他通知
until further notice.

36
00:08:29,297 --> 00:08:31,839
教师与高年级学生可以提供帮-
Faculty and upperclassmen can provide gu-

37
00:08:32,214 --> 00:08:32,630
Schnee
[James] Schnee.

38
00:08:32,672 --> 00:08:33,255
是的长官?
Yes, sir?

39
00:08:33,297 --> 00:08:37,214
我不在校区时 有发现任何人试图进入学校区域吗?
[James] Was anyone caught trying to enter the school grounds while I was away?

40
00:08:38,672 --> 00:08:39,755
没有
...No.

41
00:08:40,214 --> 00:08:42,839
你 确 定 吗?
[James] Are you sure?

42
00:08:43,839 --> 00:08:46,047
还在害怕啊 我明白了
[Cinder] Still afraid, I see.

43
00:08:46,922 --> 00:08:49,630
现在让我看看你到底把她藏哪了
Now show me where you've been hiding her.

44
00:08:55,797 --> 00:08:56,714
收到
Affirmative

45
00:08:59,380 --> 00:09:00,964
我不明白
[Weiss] I don't understand.

46
00:09:01,255 --> 00:09:04,255
为什么将军要无缘无故将我们召回?
Why would the general call us back without giving a reason?

47
00:09:04,297 --> 00:09:07,005
尤其在曼特城还在疏散的时候
Especially with evacuations still going on in Mantle.

48
00:09:07,047 --> 00:09:09,630
孩子们 你们不需要明白命令
[Elm] You don't have to understand orders, kids.

49
00:09:09,964 --> 00:09:11,547
你只需要遵从命令
You just have to follow them.

50
00:09:11,839 --> 00:09:14,255
民众转移目前不会停止
Civvy Transports won't be stopping anytime soon.

51
00:09:14,297 --> 00:09:17,089
如果将军说他现在需要我们 他就是现在需要我们
If the general says he needs us now, he needs us now.

52
00:09:17,839 --> 00:09:20,089
你们回去找将军看看发生了什么
You all get to the general and find out what's happening.

53
00:09:20,130 --> 00:09:21,755
我们会尽快带Oscar去找你们
We'll bring Oscar and see you soon.

54
00:09:28,922 --> 00:09:29,922
Ironwood将军
General Ironwood.

55
00:09:36,589 --> 00:09:39,005
我们犯了严重的错误
[James] We have made a critical error.

56
00:09:41,672 --> 00:09:45,214
黑女皇是Salem在我们失去一切前给我们的信号
The Black Queen was the symbol Salem showed us before we lost everything.

57
00:09:46,380 --> 00:09:48,464
是她告诉我们她已在内部
Her way of telling us she was inside.

58
00:09:49,755 --> 00:09:51,047
然后就太迟了
Then it was too late.

59
00:09:52,505 --> 00:09:53,630
我们阻止了Watts
We stopped Watts.

60
00:09:54,130 --> 00:09:56,922
我们阻止了Callows 但有人来过这儿了
We stopped Callows, but someone was here.

61
00:09:57,797 --> 00:10:00,589
他把这个留下 来告诉我-
They put this in my office to tell me that --

62
00:10:00,964 --> 00:10:02,505
如果曼特城只是个障眼法呢?
what if Mantle was just a distraction?

63
00:10:02,964 --> 00:10:05,755
如果一切都只是用来将我们带离学院从而 从而一
What if it was just to draw us away from the academy to, to --

64
00:10:05,797 --> 00:10:06,297
长官

65
00:10:06,339 --> 00:10:08,089
会没事的
It's going to be okay.

66
00:10:08,255 --> 00:10:10,255
曼特城现在跟我们在统一战线 而且
We've got Mantle on our side now, and --

67
00:10:10,297 --> 00:10:12,047
你又如何知道那不是他们计划的一部分?
How do we know that wasn't part of their plan?

68
00:10:12,505 --> 00:10:13,755
我们又怎能知道对方并不想让我们
How do we know they didn't want us

69
00:10:13,797 --> 00:10:15,839
将成千上万的民众带入擎天?
to bring people into Atlas by the thousands?

70
00:10:16,839 --> 00:10:18,505
在尝试拯救所有人时
In trying to save everyone,

71
00:10:18,547 --> 00:10:21,047
我们自身变成了最脆弱的目标
we left ourselves most vulnerable.

72
00:10:21,964 --> 00:10:26,047
Salem一直都在我们之前一步!
Salem has been one step ahead of us this entire time!

73
00:10:31,672 --> 00:10:33,630
是 是玻璃
It's... glass.

74
00:10:37,589 --> 00:10:38,755
黑玻璃
Black glass.

75
00:10:39,880 --> 00:10:40,964
这是Cinder留的
This was Cinder.

76
00:10:41,255 --> 00:10:42,297
她还活着?
She's alive?

77
00:10:42,839 --> 00:10:44,005
而且还在这儿?!
And she's here?!

78
00:10:46,755 --> 00:10:48,964
如果Cinder在 那么 以我们能猜测的
If Cinder's here, then, for all we know,

79
00:10:49,005 --> 00:10:49,922
Hazel或许也在!
Hazel's here, too!

80
00:10:50,339 --> 00:10:52,130
长官 这一切还没有结束
Sir, this isn't over yet.

81
00:10:53,047 --> 00:10:53,922
有我们辅佐您
We're with you.

82
00:10:57,839 --> 00:10:58,880
真是如此么?
Are you with me?

83
00:11:02,130 --> 00:11:02,922
长官?
Sir?

84
00:11:08,755 --> 00:11:12,630
Robyn是怎么知道通讯塔计划的?
How did Robyn know about the Global Communications Project?

85
00:11:18,089 --> 00:11:19,047
我们告诉她的
We told her.

86
00:11:20,172 --> 00:11:21,505
在埋伏她的那一夜
The night of the ambush.

87
00:11:22,380 --> 00:11:23,589
你做了什么?!
You did what?!

88
00:11:23,797 --> 00:11:25,464
我们只是想帮上忙
[Yang] We were trying to help.

89
00:11:25,922 --> 00:11:27,630
靠在我们背后做小动作?
[Marrow] By going behind our backs?

90
00:11:29,047 --> 00:11:30,380
等于是你把她放跑了?
Does that mean you let her escape?

91
00:11:30,422 --> 00:11:32,172
Robyn是站在我们这边的!
Robyn is on our side!

92
00:11:32,422 --> 00:11:33,464
她一直是
She always has been.

93
00:11:33,505 --> 00:11:35,339
我们当时并不能确认
[James] We didn't know that for sure.

94
00:11:35,380 --> 00:11:37,339
这些都不重要
None of this matters right now!

95
00:11:37,380 --> 00:11:39,047
忠诚一直都重要!
Loyalty always matters!

96
00:11:39,297 --> 00:11:40,089
啊啊!
Gah!

97
00:11:44,922 --> 00:11:47,672
Ironwood将军
[Salem] General Ironwood.

98
00:12:00,089 --> 00:12:05,505
击败Arthur Watts的勇敢的猎人们
The brave Huntsmen and Huntresses bested Arthur Watts.

99
00:12:06,797 --> 00:12:08,339
恭喜
Congratulations.

100
00:12:09,714 --> 00:12:11,339
我们也阻止了Tyrian
We stopped Tyrian, too.

101
00:12:11,589 --> 00:12:15,047
我们将会阻止Cinder以及你之后派来的任何其他人
And we'll stop Cinder and anyone else you try to send here.

102
00:12:16,380 --> 00:12:20,297
亲爱的姑娘 他们的目的从不是胜利
Dear girl, their goal was never victory.

103
00:12:21,089 --> 00:12:23,755
他们只是准备好了舞台
It was merely to set the stage.

104
00:12:24,422 --> 00:12:25,464
为了什么?
For what?

105
00:12:28,047 --> 00:12:29,464
为了我
For me.

106
00:12:32,547 --> 00:12:35,172
时间对你并不利 James
Time isn't on your side, James.

107
00:12:35,214 --> 00:12:37,922
时间一直都站在我这边
It's always been on mine.

108
00:12:38,880 --> 00:12:42,089
擎天的人民已经经历过了足够的痛苦
The people of Atlas have suffered enough.

109
00:12:42,547 --> 00:12:45,630
将权杖与灯交给我
Surrender the staff and the lamp to me,

110
00:12:46,339 --> 00:12:49,589
他们便无需继续痛苦下去了
and they needn't suffer any further.

111
00:12:51,839 --> 00:12:56,255
这 绝不可能
That's... not going to happen.

112
00:12:59,589 --> 00:13:03,964
直接接受你的徒劳之境吧...
Simply accept the futility of your situation...

113
00:13:05,922 --> 00:13:09,047
这样一切都可以结束了
And this can all be over.

114
00:13:09,880 --> 00:13:11,922
我们知道你的能力
We've seen what you're capable of.

115
00:13:13,297 --> 00:13:14,797
神灯告诉我们了
The lamp showed us.

116
00:13:20,505 --> 00:13:22,464
它告诉了我们一切
It showed us everything.

117
00:13:26,672 --> 00:13:28,714
我们知道你没法被杀死
We've seen that you can't be killed.

118
00:13:29,755 --> 00:13:31,630
但我们也坚信你会失败
But we've also seen you fail.

119
00:13:33,547 --> 00:13:35,589
我们不需要通过击杀来阻止你
We don't have to kill you to stop you.

120
00:13:36,422 --> 00:13:38,505
但我们会阻止你
And we will stop you.

121
00:13:43,880 --> 00:13:47,672
你妈也对我说过这些
Your mother said those words to me.

122
00:13:50,089 --> 00:13:52,464
我...母亲?
My... mother?

123
00:13:54,922 --> 00:13:56,547
她也错了
She was wrong, too.

124
00:14:25,005 --> 00:14:28,089
那就是塞伦?我们要对抗的是她?
That's Salem? That's who we're up against?

125
00:14:28,130 --> 00:14:29,755
而且她明显已经启程了
And she's apparently on her way.

126
00:14:30,089 --> 00:14:33,339
但如果任何势力接近王国我们会收到警告啊
But we'd be alerted if any forces had approached the kingdom.

127
00:14:33,630 --> 00:14:36,547
我们在整个海岸都有长途预警 而且
We have long-range proximity alarms all along the coast, and --

128
00:14:36,589 --> 00:14:39,630
它们下线了 一切都在这混乱中而我们甚至没察觉
They're offline. With all of the chaos, we didn't notice.

129
00:14:39,672 --> 00:14:41,297
瓦特肯定已经关掉它们了!
Watts must have shut them down!

130
00:14:41,339 --> 00:14:43,214
或者它们已经被摧毁了
Or they've already been destroyed.

131
00:14:54,047 --> 00:14:54,714
什么?
What?

132
00:14:55,630 --> 00:14:56,547
它们全部?
All of them?

133
00:14:59,380 --> 00:15:02,505
你在演说中称阿米特塔已经准备好发射了
You said in your speech that Amity Tower was ready to launch.

134
00:15:03,839 --> 00:15:04,755
是真的吗?
Was that true?

135
00:15:10,297 --> 00:15:11,005
不
No.

136
00:15:12,130 --> 00:15:15,255
你那么说只是为了引出瓦特
You just said that to lure out Watts.

137
00:15:19,297 --> 00:15:21,505
将军?
General Ironwood?

138
00:15:24,422 --> 00:15:26,964
我派你你姐姐去取得冬之少女的能力
I sent your sister to claim the power of the Winter Maiden.

139
00:15:28,964 --> 00:15:29,755
什么?
What?

140
00:15:30,297 --> 00:15:34,339
当我意识到我方被渗透之后 我知道事态无法一等再等了
When I realized we'd been compromised, knew we couldn't wait any longer.

141
00:15:34,714 --> 00:15:37,089
神灯和权杖必须被封存起来
The staff and the lamp have to be locked away.

142
00:15:39,714 --> 00:15:43,422
我以为...你说过我们能留下它
I thought... you said we could keep it.

143
00:15:44,005 --> 00:15:47,130
那是在你就神灯一事撒谎骗我之前
Well, that was before you lied to me about the lamp.

144
00:15:47,630 --> 00:15:52,047
欺骗我们罗宾的事之前 在塞伦已经找上我们家门之前
Before you lied to us about Robyn, before Salem was right on our doorstep.

145
00:15:52,089 --> 00:15:56,839
在曼特几乎被摧毁而我和我的部队为此精疲力尽之前!
Before Mantle was nearly destroyed, and myself and my army were left exhausted!

146
00:16:01,505 --> 00:16:05,172
计划赶不上变化 所以我们以此改变计划
The timeline has changed.And so we must change accordingly.

147
00:16:06,380 --> 00:16:07,880
命令是什么 长官?
What are our orders, sir?

148
00:16:08,380 --> 00:16:12,839
我们把对阿米特塔的计划运用到擎天城
We are going to take our plan for Amity Tower, and apply it to the city of Atlas.

149
00:16:13,839 --> 00:16:14,755
什么?!
What?!

150
00:16:16,047 --> 00:16:20,464
这本是Oz前世的计划 但他没实现那么远
It was Oz's plan in a former life. But he didn't take it far enough.

151
00:16:21,339 --> 00:16:26,214
如果我们运用杖的能力让咱们高升入大气
If we harness the power of the staff, and raise ourselves high into the atmosphere,

152
00:16:26,630 --> 00:16:30,880
城市的人工气候能让市民和食品补给免于伤害
the city's artificial climate will keep citizens and food supplies unharmed.

153
00:16:31,297 --> 00:16:33,964
能一劳永逸地脱离塞伦的影响
Always out of reach of whatever Salem may try to send our way.

154
00:16:34,922 --> 00:16:37,630
但撤离疏散远没有结束
But we're nowhere near finished evacuating everyone!

155
00:16:38,255 --> 00:16:40,255
你这是对曼特见死不救
You'd be leaving Mantle to die.

156
00:16:41,089 --> 00:16:43,380
是的就是这样
Yes... I would.

157
00:16:47,130 --> 00:16:49,922
我们不能让塞伦得到圣物
We can't allow Salem to capture the Relics.

158
00:16:50,297 --> 00:16:57,422
这是我们让圣器和四季力量远离塞伦的最好机会
This is our best chance at getting the staff, the lamp and the maiden as far away from her as possible.

159
00:16:57,630 --> 00:17:01,297
但我们有机会重新团结世界
But we have an opportunity to reunite the world.

160
00:17:01,630 --> 00:17:04,255
如果我们发射塔 我们就再次能齐心协力了
If we launch the tower, we can all work together again.

161
00:17:04,547 --> 00:17:05,797
我们甚至可以求援
We could even call for help.

162
00:17:06,089 --> 00:17:07,755
只要我们坚持够久--
If we can hold out long enough --

163
00:17:07,797 --> 00:17:12,630
有时候正道往往伴随着艰难险阻
Sometimes, doing the right thing means making tough decisions.

164
00:17:12,672 --> 00:17:13,255
你说得对
You're right.

165
00:17:14,130 --> 00:17:18,172
而我认为此刻正道即为是坚守阵地
And I think the right thing to do would be to stand our ground.

166
00:17:18,214 --> 00:17:21,047
我也如此
Me too.

167
00:17:28,880 --> 00:17:32,089
今晚曼特一役我们已然狼狈不堪
We ran ourselves ragged trying to save Mantle tonight.

168
00:17:32,672 --> 00:17:34,964
再走一遭挑战更强的对手--
We try that again against an even larger force --

169
00:17:35,005 --> 00:17:36,755
你们是猎人啊!
But you're Huntsmen and Huntresses!

170
00:17:37,047 --> 00:17:38,672
你们不能就这么临战退缩!
You can't just back down from a fight!

171
00:17:38,714 --> 00:17:42,214
想要赢得战争就不能执着于一场战斗
You can't focus on one single fight while trying to win a war.

172
00:17:42,255 --> 00:17:43,797
议会怎么说?
What's the council going to say?

173
00:17:43,964 --> 00:17:44,630
什么都不会说
Nothing.

174
00:17:45,172 --> 00:17:46,755
一旦我宣布实施军法管制
Once I declare Martial Law.

175
00:17:47,797 --> 00:17:48,464
不
No.

176
00:17:48,505 --> 00:17:49,880
那罗宾怎么办?
What about Robyn?

177
00:17:50,214 --> 00:17:52,297
你到底忠于谁
Who exactly are you loyal to?

178
00:17:52,339 --> 00:17:55,130
忠于指望我们去拯救大家的人民!
We're loyal to the people counting on us to save them!

179
00:17:55,172 --> 00:17:57,422
我们在拯救可以救的人
We are saving who we can.

180
00:17:59,922 --> 00:18:01,755
而你现在是我们的阻碍
And you're standing in our way.

181
00:18:08,797 --> 00:18:11,464
是Jaune!我们现在有大麻烦了!
It's Jaune!We have got a serious problem!

182
00:18:18,422 --> 00:18:21,339
埃隆伍德宣布戒严并抛弃曼特!
Ironwood's declaring Martial Law and abandoning Mantle!

183
00:18:21,380 --> 00:18:24,297
塞伦要来啦 他要用杖来移走擎天
Salem is coming, and he's going to use the staff to move Atlas.

184
00:18:24,339 --> 00:18:26,422
如果我们不阻止他,曼特就会被摧--
If we don't stop him, then Mantle's going to be des-

185
00:18:34,339 --> 00:18:35,630
什么?不!
What? No!

186
00:18:40,380 --> 00:18:47,214
我很抱歉走到这一步 但直到擎天和圣器安全之前 你们全被捕了
I'm sorry it's come to this, but until Atlas and the Relics are safe, you are all under arrest.

187
00:18:48,380 --> 00:18:50,589
我们不会让你就这么拿下我们
We won't just let you take us.

188
00:18:55,422 --> 00:18:56,339
我知道
I know.

189
00:19:06,547 --> 00:19:07,630
Ruby你在吗?
