190
00:19:07,880 --> 00:19:08,547
Ruby!
Ruby!

191
00:19:08,797 --> 00:19:10,630
你告诉他们了吗?
Did you tell them?

192
00:19:14,755 --> 00:19:19,464
Oscar 你在哪啊?
Oscar, where are you?